  "instructions_to_main_agent": "Implement a full Railway Block Management System (RBMS) replacing Excel systems. Support 3 roles: Block Data Entry User, Officer, and Admin. Include dashboards, block data entry form with live duration calculation, corridor validation (STRICTLY INSIDE, NEARLY CORRIDOR ±30m, PARTIAL OVERLAP, COMPLETELY OUTSIDE), free corridor slot finder with USE THIS SLOT, calendar timeline, section/department analysis, cancellation analysis, PDF/Excel report export, audit logs, conflict detection, officer approval workflow, and full mock demo accounts."
